                "m_dialog": "Gah! Oo, sorry. No offense, but yous Topsiders are terrifying to look at. You must be the infamous Scion of Bartleby. Glad you're here.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Fly_Forman_A_NPC.dds",
